{"title":"경성빵집","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bzoQmS/hzXaohIGiw/gg3Rfm4IFz6Ss1cH8kuLZk&filename=th3","synopsis":"1948년, 어머니에게 떠밀려 원치 않는 결혼을 앞둔 \n18세 소녀, \"소앙금\"의 제빵상경기!\n\n당신이랑은 절대 결혼 안 해요!\n전 그냥 빵이 만들고 싶을 뿐이라고요.\n아버지의 뒤를 이어 찐빵가게를 여는 염원을 이루기 위해\n도망치듯 서울로 향하는 기차를 탄다.\n\n서울에서의 첫날은 녹록지 않았으나,\n빵을 사랑하는 남자, \"태랑\"과 기묘한 인연이 닿아\n서울이 경성이던 시절에 지어진 어느 빵집에 다다르는데...\n대한민국 최초의 양과자점,\n「경성빵집」에서 일어나는 이야기.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":296,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":288,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-10-04","rank":291,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-06","rank":251,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-17","rank":290,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-24","rank":286,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-25","rank":245,"change":{"type":"up","amount":41}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":8365787,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":8365820,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-09","v":8365855,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-10","v":8365921,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-11","v":8365936,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":8365962,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":8366030,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":8366101,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":8366150,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":8366180,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":8366211,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":8366251,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":8366300,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":8366338,"rc":32816,"rs":324006,"cc":7347},{"date":"2026-10-21","v